00:22:00.069 --> 00:22:02.590
in verbal form not in written form.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.350
Context gets lost on email and text.

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:07.510
So to me face to face is number one,

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.130
voice is number two,

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:12.230
when I have to give a
contextual piece of information

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:13.860
that can either be very exciting

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:15.600
or potentially negative.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:18.160
I think people underestimate
the seven minute call

00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:22.078
in a 2020 environment,
and use technology to

00:22:22.078 --> 00:22:24.440
disguise themselves from a conversation

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.990
