Facebook did in 2011.

00:30:02.340 --> 00:30:04.471
There's a stunning amount of people on it.

00:30:04.471 --> 00:30:06.840
If you've been to your LinkedIn recently,

00:30:06.840 --> 00:30:08.150
and if you haven't please do,

00:30:08.150 --> 00:30:10.240
the content is no longer just business,

00:30:10.240 --> 00:30:11.600
it is absolutely everything.

00:30:11.600 --> 00:30:12.920
People's opinions, what they're eating,

00:30:12.920 --> 00:30:14.930
exercise tips, wine.

00:30:14.930 --> 00:30:16.843
It has become Facebook.

00:30:18.110 --> 00:30:21.490
The organic reach, meaning
you don't even have

00:30:21.490 --> 00:30:24.300
a LinkedIn account, you start an account

00:30:24.300 --> 00:30:26.670
for your retail store, for
your store, forget about you,

00:30:26.670 --> 00:30:27.970
for your store.

00:30:27.970 --> 00:30:31.294
And you start posting content
and people will see it

00:30:31.294 --> 00:30:34.307
without you paying for them to see it,

00:30:34.307 --> 00:30:37.140
because it's just supply and demand.

00:30:37.140 --> 00:30:39.767
The attention on the platform is greater

00:30:39.767 --> 00:30:42.290
than the content that people are making.

00:30:42.290 --> 00:30:44.150
The biggest mistake that people make

00:30:44.150 --> 00:30:46.830
when it comes to marketing is they decide

00:30:46.830 --> 00:30:49.928
a platform is not for them.

00:30:49.928 --> 00:30:52.790
You decide your customer is not on there.

00:30:52.790 --> 00:30:56.800
You decide that Tik Tok
is not for you right now

00:30:56.800 --> 00:30:59.180
because that's for 12
to 15 year old girls,

00:30:59.180 --> 00:31:03.150
and you're targeting 65 year
old males, let's just say.

00:31:03.150 --> 00:31:05.340
What you don't understand
is how communication

00:31:05.340 --> 00:31:07.370
and marketing actually works.

00:31:07.370 --> 00:31:09.190
Which is if you're thoughtful enough

00:31:09.190 --> 00:31:11.250
about the content you make, and you make

00:31:11.250 --> 00:31:13.947
a sweet little funny
video of a 15 year old

00:31:13.947 --> 00:31:18.490
and a grandpa interacting, it
can bring awareness for you.

00:31:18.490 --> 00:31:20.860
The lack of creativity or thoughtfulness,

00:31:20.860 --> 00:31:23.160
or understanding of human behavior

00:31:23.160 --> 00:31:27.110
has led so many to not
innovate or execute.

00:31:27.110 --> 00:31:30.110
The costs are remarkably low.

00:31:30.110 --> 00:31:34.070
LinkedIn scares me, how inexpensive it is.

00:31:34.070 --> 00:31:36.747
But are you the kind of organization

00:31:36.747 --> 00:31:40.130
that is willing to make
seven pieces of content

00:31:40.130 --> 00:31:41.828
for LinkedIn a day?

00:31:41.828 --> 00:31:44.540
Half this room doesn't make
seven pieces of content

00:31:44.540 --> 00:31:46.878
for social media a year.

00:31:46.878 --> 00:31:49.290
They take whatever this
organization sends them

00:31:49.290 --> 00:31:52.500
