think something's gonna happen.

00:31:52.500 --> 00:31:55.060
My friends, I don't know
what you're thinking,

00:31:55.060 --> 00:31:57.900
but no matter how remarkable
this three generation

00:31:57.900 --> 00:32:00.330
family business is that
makes the best products.

00:32:00.330 --> 00:32:02.520
If you are not paying
attention to what technology

00:32:02.520 --> 00:32:04.485
is doing to your industry,

00:32:04.485 --> 00:32:06.100
you're putting your head in the sand,

00:32:06.100 --> 00:32:08.350
and you're gonna let a
tidal wave run you over.

00:32:08.350 --> 00:32:09.710
Period.

00:32:09.710 --> 00:32:11.046
The world is not going backwards.

00:32:11.046 --> 00:32:13.990
Technology and innovation
doesn't care about

00:32:13.990 --> 00:32:15.750
how you want it to be.

00:32:15.750 --> 00:32:19.293
You must become a practitioner

00:32:19.293 --> 00:32:21.980
in communications,
because what the internet

00:32:21.980 --> 00:32:23.230
is doing my friends

00:32:23.230 --> 00:32:25.576
it is commoditizing everything

00:32:25.576 --> 00:32:27.960
but the ability to communicate.

00:32:27.960 --> 00:32:29.500
Don't get it twisted.

00:32:29.500 --> 00:32:30.670
It's happened.

00:32:30.670 --> 00:32:34.478
And how you want it to be
isn't gonna change that.

